        <message_html><![CDATA[<p><img title="" src="u_emblem_email_e_001.jpgx" alt="" width="150" height="97" align="bottom" border="" hspace="" vspace="" />&nbsp;</p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'calibri light'; font-size: 15pt; color: #4c8c2b;">NOTICE</span></p>
<p><a title="Le fran&ccedil;ais suit" href="#francais"> <em>Le fran&ccedil;ais suit.</em> </a></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>Please do not reply to this email. This system cannot receive messages.</strong></p>
<p><span style="font-family: calibri; font-size: 22pt; color: #4c8c2b;">New HIRA to complete</span></p>
<p><span style="background-color: rgb(var(--sn-tinymce_content-background,var(--now-form-field--background-color,var(--now-color_background--primary,var(--now-color--neutral-0,255,255,255))))); color: rgb(var(--sn-tinymce_content-text,var(--now-form-field--color,var(--now-color_text--primary,var(--now-color--neutral-18,22,27,28)))));">This email serves to advise you that a HIRA has been created and requires your attention. Below is the information regarding the position requiring assessment:</span></p>
<div>
<p>Position title: ${position_reporting_position}</p>
<p>Department: ${position_reporting_position.reports_to.department}</p>
</div>
<p>Created on: ${sys_created_on}</p>
<p>To assist you with your Hazard Identification and Risk Assessment you may refer to&nbsp;<a href="https://hoccdc.sharepoint.com/sites/atrium/en/Pages/service.aspx?s=/sites/info/en/services/hoc-health-and-wellness/Pages/Workplace-Safety-and-Hazard-Prevention.aspx&amp;u=/sites/info/en/services/hoc-health-and-wellness/&amp;n=Workplace-Safety-and-Hazard-Prevention&amp;cg=%28acg:%22071c070c-abf7-4d9a-9601-9b425668fc61%22%29&amp;sb=%28sbj:%22e7552958-51e7-41a1-a214-4b4ccc02e40c%22%29">the Workplace Safety and Hazard Prevention</a>&nbsp;page on Atrium.</p>
<p>Please click the link below to view and action this file.</p>
<p>${URI_REF}</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>Thank you,</p>
<div>
<p><strong>Occupational Health and Safety</strong></p>
<p>House of Commons</p>
<p>50 O&rsquo;Connor, 8<span data-fontsize="11">th</span> floor <br />Ottawa, Ontario, K1A 0A6</p>
<p><a href="mailto:OHS-SST@parl.gc.ca" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">OHS-SST@parl.gc.ca</a></p>
<p>Office: 613-995-3614</p>
</div>
<hr noshade="noshade" />
<p><span style="font-family: 'calibri light'; font-size: 15pt; color: #4c8c2b;">AVIS</span></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>Pri&egrave;re de ne pas r&eacute;pondre au pr&eacute;sent courriel, car il provient d&rsquo;une adresse qui ne peut pas recevoir de messages.</strong></p>
<p><span style="font-family: calibri; font-size: 22pt; color: #4c8c2b;">Nouveau R.E.R. &agrave; compl&eacute;ter</span></p>
<p>Ce courriel sert &agrave; vous informer qu'un R.E.R. a &eacute;t&eacute; cr&eacute;&eacute; et n&eacute;cessite votre attention. Vous trouverez ci-dessous les informations concernant le poste n&eacute;cessitant une &eacute;valuation :</p>
<p>Titre du poste : ${mail_script:x_hccc_hoc_ohs_hira_translate_position_reporting_position}</p>
<p>D&eacute;partement : ${mail_script:x_hccc_hoc_ohs_hira_translate_department}</p>
<p>Cr&eacute;&eacute; le : ${sys_created_on}</p>
<p>Pour vous aider dans votre identification des dangers et votre &eacute;valuation des risques, vous pouvez vous r&eacute;f&eacute;rer &agrave; la page&nbsp;<a href="https://hoccdc.sharepoint.com/sites/atrium/fr/Pages/service.aspx?s=/sites/info/fr/services/hoc-health-and-wellness/Pages/Workplace-Safety-and-Hazard-Prevention.aspx&amp;u=/sites/info/fr/services/hoc-health-and-wellness/&amp;n=Workplace-Safety-and-Hazard-Prevention&amp;cg=%28acg:%22071c070c-abf7-4d9a-9601-9b425668fc61%22%29&amp;sb=%28sbj:%22e7552958-51e7-41a1-a214-4b4ccc02e40c%22%29">S&eacute;curit&eacute; et pr&eacute;vention des risques en milieu de travail</a>&nbsp;sur Atrium.</p>
<p>Veuillez cliquer sur le lien ci-dessous pour visualiser et traiter ce cas.</p>
<p>${URI_REF}</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>Merci,</p>
<div>
<p><strong>Sant&eacute; et s&eacute;curit&eacute; au travail</strong></p>
<p>Chambre des communes</p>
<p>50 Rue O&rsquo;Connor, 8<span data-fontsize="11">e</span> &eacute;tage <br />Ottawa, Ontario, K1A 0A6</p>
<p><a href="mailto:OHS-SST@parl.gc.ca" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">OHS-SST@parl.gc.ca</a></p>
<p>Bureau: 613-995-3614</p>
</div>]]></message_html>
